# Cloudflare Pages redirects — canonical, specific (never a catch-all).
# Precedence: these rules run first, then static assets, then 404.html.
# So known aliases 301 to the real page; everything else falls through to
# the built 404.html (served with a proper 404 status). No SPA catch-all.

/the-app         /app         301
/the-calculator  /calculator  301
